Package: cinminai-search
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Cin-MinAI <https://github.com/Cin-MinAI/Cin-MinAI>
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Depends: python3 (>= 3.12), python3 (<< 3.13)
Description: the Cin-MinAI assistant's own search (SearXNG)
 The pinned SearXNG metasearch, run on this computer for the assistant's web
 search: it asks DuckDuckGo and Bing at once, for pages and for pictures, and
 gives the assistant one clean list. It answers only on a private socket for
 this user, starts when the assistant searches and stops after 15 minutes
 without a search. Every search is still asked first. Requests go out as what
 they are: no disguise as a browser, and an engine that refuses is set aside,
 never fooled. How it was built: /usr/share/doc/cinminai-search/BUILDINFO.
